     3,
     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n        Hello everyone, <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        I am trying to assess the presence of phylogenetic signal in\r\n        shape data using K-multiv. However, I am obtaining extremely low\r\n        values of K (0.003) but with significant p-values. Of course,\r\n        values close to 0 indicate the absene of phylogenetic signal but\r\n        they are extremely low. Also happens with size data.<br>\r\n        I wonder if this make sense in terms of no phylogenetic signal.\r\n        Thanks in advance!<br>\r\n        B-<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        PS.shape &lt;- physignal(A=gdf2$Y3,phy=mytree,iter=9999,\r\n        print.progress = TRUE)<br>\r\n      </div></blockquote></div>"
